# arc #63 P1: the vendored philox32 files are pinned byte-for-byte to a
# specific upstream commit (see each file's own header comment) and gated by
# a SHA-256 drift check (tests/test_philox32.py::test_vendored_body_matches_
# its_recorded_hash). Force LF regardless of any machine's core.autocrlf so a
# checkout never silently rewrites the vendored bytes and trips that check.
cpp/src/philox32.h text eol=lf
src/simulation/philox32.py text eol=lf
tests/data/philox4x32_10_kat.txt text eol=lf
